WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:27.090
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.360 --> 01:34.940
[The Great Long March]

3
01:35.330 --> 01:37.800
[Episode 29]

4
01:38.640 --> 01:39.560
Zizhen!

5
01:39.870 --> 01:42.030
Zizhen, stay with me. Zizhen!

6
01:42.120 --> 01:43.650
[He Zizhen, wife of Mao Zedong]

7
01:42.229 --> 01:44.229
Please, don't fall asleep, Zizhen.

8
01:43.759 --> 01:46.360
[Qian Xijun, wife of Mao Zemin]

9
01:45.120 --> 01:46.039
- Zizhen. - Zizhen.

10
01:46.039 --> 01:48.150
I've already sent someone to fetch Zedong.

11
01:48.150 --> 01:49.479
The Military Commission headquarters isn't far from here.

12
01:49.400 --> 01:51.570
[Mao Zemin, Political Commissar of the 15th Detachment, Military Commission Column]

13
01:49.660 --> 01:51.590
He'll come here very soon, Zizhen.

14
01:51.950 --> 01:52.950
Don't fall asleep, Zizhen.

15
01:52.950 --> 01:53.479
Zizhen.

16
01:53.479 --> 01:54.950
Don't sleep, Zizhen.

17
01:55.210 --> 01:58.360
Talk to me, Zizhen. Zizhen.

18
01:59.000 --> 01:59.640
Zizhen.

19
02:01.390 --> 02:02.190
Zizhen.

20
02:03.120 --> 02:03.590
Zizhen.

21
02:03.590 --> 02:05.450
He'll be here any moment.

22
02:04.020 --> 02:05.890
[Lin Boqu, Director of the General Commission for Confiscation and Requisition of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission]

23
02:05.590 --> 02:06.120
Runzhi.

24
02:07.200 --> 02:08.310
Don't fall asleep.

25
02:08.750 --> 02:10.080
Wake up.

26
02:12.850 --> 02:13.240
Runzhi.

27
02:13.240 --> 02:14.520
Don't sleep, Zizhen.

28
02:15.820 --> 02:17.430
Zizhen.

29
02:21.170 --> 02:22.130
Runzhi's here.

30
02:26.070 --> 02:26.760
Chairman.

31
02:26.890 --> 02:27.800
Runzhi.

32
02:28.560 --> 02:30.240
Chairman.

33
03:02.120 --> 03:05.920
Chairman, she has seventeen wounds all over her body.

34
03:06.510 --> 03:09.350
And some of the shrapnel can't be removed.

35
03:09.750 --> 03:11.080
Our medical conditions

36
03:11.100 --> 03:12.800
are just too poor.

37
04:57.770 --> 05:00.330
Maomao's shoes are gone.

38
05:02.080 --> 05:03.560
His feet are cold.

39
05:04.640 --> 05:06.320
We have to find them.

40
05:08.140 --> 05:09.870
We must get them back.

41
05:11.370 --> 05:13.810
I saw him.

42
05:14.460 --> 05:18.530
♪ One star ♪

43
05:18.560 --> 05:23.050
♪ Two stars ♪

44
05:24.060 --> 05:32.580
♪ The stars light the road, I dare to walk on ♪

45
05:34.230 --> 05:41.940
♪ Walk till dawn, when the rooster crows ♪

46
05:36.530 --> 05:37.560
Runzhi.

47
05:41.110 --> 05:42.960
Why are you here?

48
05:43.930 --> 05:54.280
♪ Little stars hide and play peekaboo with me ♪

49
05:45.010 --> 05:46.280
Runzhi.

50
05:47.170 --> 05:48.440
In the future,

51
05:49.300 --> 05:51.550
if we have another child,

52
05:54.980 --> 05:58.130
can we please not send them away?

53
06:40.920 --> 06:42.750
In late April 1935,

54
06:43.159 --> 06:45.240
acting on orders from the Central Revolutionary Military Commission,

55
06:45.240 --> 06:46.240
9th Red Army Corps

56
06:46.430 --> 06:48.360
moved on from Shuicheng, Guizhou,

57
06:48.360 --> 06:50.490
heading toward Xuanwei, Yunnan.

58
06:51.310 --> 06:52.950
The main force of the Central Red Army

59
06:52.950 --> 06:54.680
quickly pushed through Pingyi

60
06:54.760 --> 06:58.280
and kept advancing west toward Zhanyi and Qujing.

61
06:58.630 --> 06:59.830
On April 27,

62
07:00.000 --> 07:01.400
the Red Army took Malong,

63
07:01.680 --> 07:04.140
its vanguard driving straight for Kunming.

64
07:05.550 --> 07:08.590
[Kunming, Yunnan]

65
07:06.210 --> 07:08.380
I simply can't believe

66
07:09.190 --> 07:12.460
the Communists would give up crossing the Jinsha River northward

67
07:12.460 --> 07:14.670
[Long Yun, Commander-in-Chief of the Second Route Army of the Kuomintang Pursuit and Suppression Forces, Chairman of the Yunnan Provincial Government]

68
07:12.750 --> 07:14.740
and instead come straight to attack Kunming.

69
07:14.740 --> 07:16.380
[Gao Yinhuai, Commander of Kunming's City Defenses, Yunnan Army]

70
07:15.270 --> 07:16.270
What do you think?

71
07:17.720 --> 07:19.790
[Lu Han, Yunnan Provincial Superintendent of Militia Affairs of Kuomintang]

72
07:18.000 --> 07:19.870
The Communists' line of march

73
07:20.190 --> 07:22.120
is too close to Kunming.

74
07:22.480 --> 07:24.840
We should still be prepared, to be safe.

75
07:24.870 --> 07:26.630
I want to be safe too,

76
07:27.000 --> 07:28.130
so let me ask you now:

77
07:28.360 --> 07:30.360
what troops do you have left to move?

78
07:33.720 --> 07:35.680
The moment I ask, you all go silent.

79
07:37.120 --> 07:38.560
It's almost laughable.

80
07:38.920 --> 07:41.720
Ever since the Communists fled west from Qiannan,

81
07:41.800 --> 07:43.270
I've thought day and night

82
07:43.680 --> 07:45.880
about how to avoid Generalissimo's

83
07:45.950 --> 07:47.800
scheme of driving the tiger to swallow the wolf.

84
07:47.800 --> 07:49.400
I've been afraid that one day

85
07:49.710 --> 07:51.230
I would repeat

86
07:51.250 --> 07:52.659
Wang Jialie's mistakes.

87
07:53.600 --> 07:54.600
And what happened?

88
07:54.600 --> 07:56.800
Not only did the Communists enter Yunnan,

89
07:56.800 --> 07:59.000
they're heading straight for Kunming.

90
07:59.830 --> 08:02.680
I've been forced to give up the border cities

91
08:03.070 --> 08:04.600
just to save my own capital.

92
08:04.950 --> 08:06.310
You mean

93
08:07.060 --> 08:10.390
we should call Xue Yue's forces south to reinforce Kunming?

94
08:10.600 --> 08:12.130
What other choice do I have?

95
08:12.490 --> 08:14.720
What if Xue Yue does what he did in Guiyang

96
08:14.720 --> 08:16.070
and refuses to leave once he's in Kunming?

97
08:16.070 --> 08:17.220
Good question.

98
08:18.480 --> 08:20.120
Then all we can do is bet

99
08:20.410 --> 08:22.240
that the Communists are only passing through westward,

100
08:22.240 --> 08:23.590
and that crossing the river is still their goal.

101
08:23.590 --> 08:25.830
Generalissimo Chiang won't just stand by

102
08:25.830 --> 08:28.090
and watch the Communists enter Sichuan.

103
08:28.120 --> 08:29.070
That said,

104
08:29.310 --> 08:31.640
we still can't be completely unprepared.

105
08:31.920 --> 08:32.669
Here's what we'll do.

106
08:32.669 --> 08:34.150
Send an urgent wire to Sun Du:

107
08:34.150 --> 08:35.840
tell him to stop trailing

108
08:35.840 --> 08:36.820
behind the Central Army,

109
08:36.820 --> 08:37.720
and march day and night

110
08:37.720 --> 08:38.610
back here to defend Kunming.

111
08:38.610 --> 08:39.280
Yes, sir.

112
08:42.360 --> 08:44.020
Do any of you have other ideas?

113
08:47.380 --> 08:49.310
Brilliant, Commander-in-Chief.

114
08:54.370 --> 08:55.720
Long Yun's telegram says

115
08:55.720 --> 08:56.750
the Zhu-Mao Communists

116
08:56.750 --> 08:58.150
may move west from Qujing

117
08:58.320 --> 09:00.320
and cross the river toward Yuanmou.

118
09:00.320 --> 09:02.030
He asks the Generalissimo to send the Central Army

119
09:02.030 --> 09:04.150
to pursue from Pingyi toward Qujing,

120
09:04.560 --> 09:06.620
and catch the Communists in a pincer.

121
09:06.790 --> 09:07.750
Long Yun only

122
09:08.150 --> 09:09.410
comes begging for help

123
09:09.550 --> 09:10.950
when he's in a tight spot.

124
09:11.170 --> 09:13.270
If the Zhu-Mao Communists weren't bearing down on Kunming,

125
09:13.270 --> 09:15.470
he'd never have remembered Xue Boling.

126
09:15.670 --> 09:16.320
Right.

127
09:16.700 --> 09:19.240
I hear when Boling led troops into Yunnan before,

128
09:19.240 --> 09:21.630
Chairman Long even sent a letter saying,

129
09:22.440 --> 09:25.500
"If you come to the province alone, that's delightful.

130
09:25.750 --> 09:28.950
If you bring a great army along, that won't be necessary."

131
09:29.750 --> 09:30.550
While begging

132
09:30.610 --> 09:31.720
for help,

133
09:31.750 --> 09:33.750
he also sent an urgent wire to Sun Du,

134
09:33.790 --> 09:36.080
ordering him to rush back and defend Kunming.

135
09:36.080 --> 09:36.750
You see,

136
09:37.240 --> 09:38.480
that's how Long Yun

137
09:38.780 --> 09:40.810
outmaneuvers Wang Jialie.

138
09:41.240 --> 09:42.320
He always

139
09:42.630 --> 09:44.160
keeps a trick up his sleeve.

140
09:44.240 --> 09:46.870
But the Zhu-Mao Communists bearing down on Kunming is a fact.

141
09:46.870 --> 09:49.360
So whether Chairman Long keeps his guard up or not,

142
09:49.360 --> 09:51.390
Commander Xue has to go there.

143
09:51.750 --> 09:53.080
Send a wire to Xue Boling:

144
09:53.080 --> 09:55.140
reinforce Kunming at once, no delay.

145
09:55.150 --> 09:55.770
Yes, sir.

146
10:01.900 --> 10:05.370
[The mountains of Yunnan]

147
10:02.680 --> 10:03.720
All of you, get up!

148
10:03.870 --> 10:05.510
Sir, I can't go on, sir.

149
10:06.870 --> 10:07.270
Get up!

150
10:07.270 --> 10:08.790
Sir! Sir!

151
10:09.150 --> 10:10.280
I really can't walk.

152
10:10.550 --> 10:11.510
Get up, all of you!

153
10:11.510 --> 10:12.150
You, I'm talking to you.

154
10:12.150 --> 10:12.750
Get up!

155
10:12.870 --> 10:14.240
Get up. Get up!

156
10:14.240 --> 10:14.960
We haven't even fought a battle yet.

157
10:14.960 --> 10:16.230
Keep moving.

158
10:16.480 --> 10:17.240
Get up!

159
10:17.260 --> 10:18.500
Sir! Sir!

160
10:18.720 --> 10:19.150
Get up!

161
10:19.150 --> 10:20.000
Sir, this road is too hard.

162
10:20.000 --> 10:20.320
Get up!

163
10:20.320 --> 10:20.720
Sir.

164
10:21.150 --> 10:22.350
Sir, stop hitting me!

165
10:22.360 --> 10:22.790
Get up!

166
10:24.160 --> 10:25.950
Get up, get up, hurry!

167
10:26.320 --> 10:27.240
Get up now!

168
10:30.190 --> 10:31.050
Get up!

169
10:31.070 --> 10:32.220
Sir!

170
10:34.240 --> 10:35.240
Stop!

171
10:55.830 --> 10:56.690
Commander Xue.

172
11:06.250 --> 11:06.890
Shoes.

173
11:07.510 --> 11:08.840
Bring me a pair of shoes.

174
11:15.880 --> 11:17.390
Commander Xue, I'll do it myself.

175
11:17.390 --> 11:18.050
Don't move.

176
11:22.720 --> 11:23.690
See that?

177
11:23.710 --> 11:25.040
This fool's a lucky one.

178
11:25.050 --> 11:26.510
Thank you, Commander Xue.

179
11:34.030 --> 11:34.960
Men,

180
11:35.320 --> 11:37.030
the Communists fleeing into Yunnan

181
11:37.030 --> 11:38.760
are already at their last gasp.

182
11:39.390 --> 11:40.790
I know you're exhausted.

183
11:41.320 --> 11:43.400
But if we're tired, they're even more so.

184
11:43.400 --> 11:45.360
If we push on with all we've got now,

185
11:45.530 --> 11:47.410
fight hard, and move fast,

186
11:48.080 --> 11:49.360
we can wipe the Communists out

187
11:49.360 --> 11:50.890
right here around Kunming.

188
11:51.960 --> 11:53.130
Right here in Kunming,

189
11:53.130 --> 11:55.400
Chairman Long has our reward ready,

190
11:55.640 --> 11:57.640
and every one of you will share in it.

191
12:14.510 --> 12:15.740
I'll walk with you.

192
12:18.790 --> 12:19.650
Come on, get up.

193
12:19.710 --> 12:21.030
The commander's gone. Why aren't you moving?

194
12:21.030 --> 12:21.790
Let's go. Let's go.

195
12:21.790 --> 12:22.440
Get up, all of you!

196
12:22.440 --> 12:23.040
Move, move, move!

197
12:23.040 --> 12:23.880
Everyone up!

198
12:31.450 --> 12:34.490
Every day they say the Communists are at their last gasp.

199
12:34.490 --> 12:36.380
We've chased them for over half a year,

200
12:36.380 --> 12:38.510
and they still haven't been finished off.

201
12:38.510 --> 12:39.550
Funny thing is,

202
12:39.750 --> 12:41.950
the Communists are flesh and blood too.

203
12:42.150 --> 12:43.600
They can't even get enough to eat.

204
12:43.600 --> 12:45.280
How come all this marching hasn't worn them down?

205
12:45.280 --> 12:46.540
Why do the Communists fight?

206
12:46.540 --> 12:47.600
Why do we fight?

207
12:48.080 --> 12:49.940
They fight for the common people,

208
12:50.000 --> 12:51.120
for us poor folk.

209
12:51.330 --> 12:53.000
The two of us aren't cut out for that.

210
12:53.000 --> 12:53.600
One of these days,

211
12:53.600 --> 12:55.170
I'll take off this soldier's uniform for good.

212
12:55.170 --> 12:56.370
Keep your voice down.

213
12:56.670 --> 12:57.360
If the officer hears us,

214
12:57.360 --> 12:58.200
we're dead.

215
13:00.560 --> 13:02.490
Are you sure this is the right road?

216
13:02.560 --> 13:04.000
It all looks the same to me.

217
13:04.000 --> 13:06.330
The vanguard hired several local guides.

218
13:06.390 --> 13:07.450
It should be right.

219
13:07.560 --> 13:08.410
Besides,

220
13:08.460 --> 13:10.720
we've already sent men ahead to Kunming,

221
13:11.120 --> 13:13.390
asking Chairman Long to send a batch of

222
13:13.630 --> 13:15.960
high-precision military maps as soon as possible.

223
13:15.960 --> 13:18.360
Commander-in-Chief, this mountain road is brutal.

224
13:18.360 --> 13:19.820
You should ride the horse.

225
13:20.030 --> 13:20.750
No.

226
13:21.870 --> 13:23.780
I have to walk at least part of the way.

227
13:23.780 --> 13:29.430
[Zhanyi County, Yunnan]

228
13:48.450 --> 13:48.870
Freeze!

229
13:48.870 --> 13:49.530
Don't move!

230
13:49.750 --> 13:50.440
Don't move. Out of the car!

231
13:50.440 --> 13:50.750
Hurry!

232
13:50.750 --> 13:51.480
Surrender your arms and you'll be spared.

233
13:51.480 --> 13:52.080
Put down your guns.

234
13:52.080 --> 13:52.880
Get down, now!

235
13:52.960 --> 13:54.150
Don't shoot! Don't shoot!

236
13:54.150 --> 13:55.480
Don't shoot! Don't shoot!

237
13:55.480 --> 13:55.840
Out of the car!

238
13:55.840 --> 13:57.360
Don't move! Don't move!

239
13:57.640 --> 13:59.720
Out! Out! Open the door!

240
14:00.180 --> 14:00.630
Where are the guns?

241
14:00.630 --> 14:01.320
Don't shoot!

242
14:01.320 --> 14:02.030
Hurry!

243
14:02.230 --> 14:04.700
[Lv Liping, Operations Staff Officer, First Bureau, Military Commission]

244
14:03.120 --> 14:04.320
Which unit are you with?

245
14:04.320 --> 14:05.240
I'm...

246
14:05.630 --> 14:07.360
the Pursuit Force... no, no...

247
14:07.510 --> 14:09.910
I'm an adjutant on Xue Yue's staff.

248
14:10.480 --> 14:12.000
What's this truck carrying?

249
14:12.000 --> 14:14.590
Chairman Long in Kunming

250
14:14.930 --> 14:17.220
sent these supplies to Commander Xue.

251
14:18.120 --> 14:18.780
Yunnan ham,

252
14:19.170 --> 14:19.980
Pu'er tea,

253
14:20.480 --> 14:21.340
Yunnan Baiyao,

254
14:21.750 --> 14:22.320
and...

255
14:22.320 --> 14:24.320
Staff Officer Lv, come look at this.

256
14:31.130 --> 14:34.380
[Kunming County]

257
14:34.600 --> 14:35.450
Good.

258
14:35.910 --> 14:37.040
Just what we needed.

259
14:37.980 --> 14:44.430
[Xitun Village, Qujing, Yunnan]

260
14:38.260 --> 14:39.900
Fifteen.

261
14:44.750 --> 14:46.320
Sixteen.

262
14:47.090 --> 14:48.900
Good, next.

263
14:50.780 --> 14:54.220
Seventeen.

264
14:59.000 --> 14:59.960
Comrades,

265
15:00.910 --> 15:02.210
a major haul.

266
15:03.120 --> 15:04.710
Our Military Commission's advance reconnaissance team

267
15:04.710 --> 15:06.310
has just seized a truck.

268
15:06.650 --> 15:08.890
It's loaded with supplies Long Yun sent to Xue Yue.

269
15:08.890 --> 15:10.240
Plenty of ham,

270
15:10.270 --> 15:11.730
Pu'er tea, Yunnan Baiyao,

271
15:11.840 --> 15:13.270
and twenty copies of

272
15:13.270 --> 15:15.130
1:100,000-scale maps of Yunnan.

273
15:18.330 --> 15:19.420
Wonderful.

274
15:19.990 --> 15:21.420
This is a real treasure.

275
15:21.450 --> 15:22.500
With these maps,

276
15:22.960 --> 15:24.550
we won't have to struggle to find our way.

277
15:24.550 --> 15:25.360
Great.

278
15:25.380 --> 15:26.900
Back when Liu Bei entered Sichuan,

279
15:26.900 --> 15:28.960
Zhang Song handed over the map of Western Sichuan.

280
15:28.960 --> 15:30.080
Today we enter Yunnan,

281
15:30.080 --> 15:32.540
and Chairman Long hands us the map of Yunnan.

282
15:32.600 --> 15:33.600
A great thing.

283
15:33.880 --> 15:34.870
A heaven-sent blessing.

284
15:34.870 --> 15:35.600
That's right.

285
15:35.600 --> 15:35.870
Yes.

286
15:35.870 --> 15:37.440
Long Yun sent Xue Yue a gift.

287
15:38.360 --> 15:39.530
He didn't send it by air.

288
15:39.530 --> 15:41.060
He sent a truck instead.

289
15:41.410 --> 15:42.650
Was it an accident,

290
15:42.680 --> 15:44.440
or on purpose?

291
15:44.800 --> 15:46.280
Accident or not, that's beside the point.

292
15:46.280 --> 15:47.590
The point is, right now,

293
15:47.590 --> 15:49.800
Chairman Long in Kunming wants what we want.

294
15:49.800 --> 15:52.010
He wants our Red Army out of Yunnan fast,

295
15:52.060 --> 15:53.060
and into Sichuan.

296
15:54.530 --> 15:57.080
Enlai, get those supplies out fast.

297
15:57.110 --> 15:58.170
Already arranged.

298
15:58.220 --> 16:00.870
Military maps are going to every Corps headquarters.

299
16:00.870 --> 16:03.390
Ham and Pu'er tea are going to the mess squads of every company.

300
16:03.390 --> 16:05.030
The men can have the ham first,

301
16:05.030 --> 16:06.490
then tea to cut the grease.

302
16:06.640 --> 16:07.970
This hits the spot.

303
16:08.450 --> 16:10.740
Today the 9th Corps took Xuanwei

304
16:10.770 --> 16:12.100
without firing a shot.

305
16:12.750 --> 16:15.150
Our comrades and the whole town

306
16:15.170 --> 16:16.630
are all eating Yunnan ham.

307
16:16.670 --> 16:17.600
At first,

308
16:17.790 --> 16:20.650
I have to admit, I was watching and feeling envious.

309
16:20.690 --> 16:22.290
I knew you'd be craving some.

310
16:22.290 --> 16:24.290
Today I'm here to feed that craving.

311
16:25.330 --> 16:26.210
Look at this.

312
16:26.830 --> 16:27.590
Wonderful.

313
16:27.620 --> 16:28.680
Come, let's feast.

314
16:29.410 --> 16:30.140
Have a piece.

315
16:30.890 --> 16:31.680
Here, Mao.

316
16:31.890 --> 16:32.400
Come on.

317
16:33.130 --> 16:33.680
Thanks.

318
16:33.710 --> 16:34.910
I'll have a piece too.

319
16:35.200 --> 16:36.240
Let me taste it.

320
16:36.790 --> 16:37.850
You taste it first.

321
16:37.860 --> 16:39.070
Smells great.

322
16:39.630 --> 16:40.690
This Yunnan Baiyao

323
16:41.260 --> 16:42.930
is going mostly to the Military Commission Column

324
16:42.930 --> 16:44.720
and the hospitals of every Corps.

325
16:44.720 --> 16:46.910
It's a wonder drug for wounds.

326
16:47.110 --> 16:49.260
Since the rest-and-recovery company has many serious cases,

327
16:49.260 --> 16:50.910
I set aside a bit more for them.

328
16:50.910 --> 16:52.770
Comrade Zizhen will get some too.

329
16:53.040 --> 16:54.960
The four elder comrades and the women have been

330
16:54.960 --> 16:56.970
carrying the wounded and rallying support,

331
16:56.970 --> 16:59.090
despite having plenty of injuries of their own.

332
16:59.090 --> 16:59.720
Also,

333
17:00.040 --> 17:02.700
during the enemy bombing at Baishui yesterday,

334
17:02.860 --> 17:04.920
Comrade Shangkun hurt his lower leg.

335
17:05.040 --> 17:07.200
I sent Comrade Li Bozhao to take him a packet

336
17:07.200 --> 17:08.460
and pass on my regards.

337
17:09.640 --> 17:10.310
Enlai,

338
17:10.349 --> 17:12.030
you really

339
17:12.060 --> 17:13.319
covered every detail.

340
17:14.119 --> 17:17.950
If Comrade Shangkun sees his wife bringing him medicine,

341
17:18.160 --> 17:20.599
his wound will heal even faster.

342
17:23.130 --> 17:24.060
Comrade Zedong,

343
17:24.550 --> 17:26.550
the Yunnan Army and Xue Yue's troops

344
17:26.589 --> 17:28.310
have all pulled back to Kunming.

345
17:28.310 --> 17:30.200
Shouldn't we be thinking

346
17:30.440 --> 17:32.640
about heading north to cross the river?

347
17:32.790 --> 17:33.770
We've got the space,

348
17:33.770 --> 17:35.030
but we still need time.

349
17:35.240 --> 17:36.030
Look,

350
17:36.200 --> 17:38.610
on our way to the Jinsha River,

351
17:39.030 --> 17:41.160
there are still large local militias,

352
17:41.680 --> 17:42.750
county garrisons,

353
17:42.790 --> 17:44.000
and river-defense units along the banks.

354
17:44.000 --> 17:45.460
If we don't draw them away,

355
17:45.800 --> 17:47.330
they'll slow our crossing.

356
17:49.200 --> 17:50.110
Right.

357
17:51.750 --> 17:52.680
So you're saying

358
17:52.890 --> 17:54.480
the feint on Kunming

359
17:55.150 --> 17:56.590
needs more fuel.

360
17:57.790 --> 17:58.790
More fuel.

361
17:59.110 --> 18:00.040
This show of ours

362
18:00.100 --> 18:02.260
has to reach Chairman Long's ears,

363
18:02.960 --> 18:04.410
and touch his heart.

364
18:08.280 --> 18:09.940
We make a show of going one way,

365
18:10.160 --> 18:11.640
and slip through another.

366
18:12.250 --> 18:13.120
Exactly.

367
18:13.400 --> 18:15.130
I haven't had fish mint in ages.

368
18:15.300 --> 18:16.100
Smells great.

369
18:18.680 --> 18:19.920
You guys like this?

370
18:20.000 --> 18:20.630
We love it.

371
18:22.300 --> 18:24.130
Chairman, good, isn't it?

372
18:25.520 --> 18:27.520
Here, take it.

373
18:28.350 --> 18:29.570
Let's swap.

374
18:37.690 --> 18:44.260
[Yanglin Town, on the outskirts of Kunming, Yunnan]

375
18:46.640 --> 18:47.750
Granny, take this.

376
18:47.770 --> 18:48.970
All right, all right.

377
18:53.350 --> 18:53.960
Come on.

378
19:04.920 --> 19:05.860
Fellow villager,

379
19:05.860 --> 19:07.660
come over here.

380
19:08.640 --> 19:09.670
Comrade,

381
19:09.940 --> 19:11.960
what are you gathering all this bamboo for?

382
19:11.960 --> 19:12.960
To build ladders,

383
19:13.470 --> 19:14.800
scale Kunming's walls,

384
19:15.310 --> 19:16.480
and grab Long Yun alive.

385
19:16.480 --> 19:17.610
Grab Long Yun alive!

386
19:18.480 --> 19:19.480
Collect your money over there.

387
19:19.480 --> 19:20.480
All right.

388
19:23.310 --> 19:25.270
Commander, where do we paste these?

389
19:25.270 --> 19:26.000
Everywhere.

390
19:25.770 --> 19:28.360
[Mao Zhenhua, Company Commander of the 3rd Company, 1st Battalion, 4th Regiment]

391
19:26.270 --> 19:27.750
Anywhere a person can see,

392
19:27.960 --> 19:28.960
paste them up.

393
19:29.120 --> 19:30.120
Yes, sir.

394
19:31.350 --> 19:33.360
Commander, can pasting slogans win me merit?

395
19:33.360 --> 19:34.320
Why wouldn't it?

396
19:34.580 --> 19:37.070
Whether you win merit depends on how you perform.

397
19:37.070 --> 19:38.240
Then I'll perform my best,

398
19:38.240 --> 19:39.270
learn from you,

399
19:39.500 --> 19:40.780
and do whatever you do.

400
19:41.510 --> 19:43.030
All right, Yun Guichuan.

401
19:43.310 --> 19:44.680
Your attitude these days

402
19:44.680 --> 19:46.070
is getting more and more progressive.

403
19:46.070 --> 19:48.000
How could I not improve when I'm learning from you?

404
19:48.000 --> 19:48.800
Yun Guichuan,

405
19:49.070 --> 19:50.440
if you're going to learn,

406
19:50.440 --> 19:51.700
learn the good things.

407
19:52.240 --> 19:53.830
Skip the flattery.

408
19:54.150 --> 19:56.700
Wang Youcai, count your bamboo poles.

409
19:57.620 --> 20:00.150
Don't drag down my company's ideological progress.

410
20:00.150 --> 20:01.080
Right.

411
20:01.380 --> 20:03.920
[Huang Kaixiang, Commander of the 4th Regiment]

412
20:02.810 --> 20:03.540
Mao Zhenhua.

413
20:03.570 --> 20:04.170
Here.

414
20:07.740 --> 20:09.370
Who's dragging down your ideological progress?

415
20:09.370 --> 20:10.020
No, no one.

416
20:13.390 --> 20:15.190
I've got a task for your company.

417
20:15.960 --> 20:17.510
Put together a plainclothes squad.

418
20:17.510 --> 20:20.520
Take plenty of slogans and banners,

419
20:20.550 --> 20:21.680
head into Kunming,

420
20:22.240 --> 20:24.570
and spread them everywhere. Understood?

421
20:25.010 --> 20:26.950
Understood. We'll get it done.

422
20:27.550 --> 20:28.270
Go.

423
20:29.270 --> 20:29.880
Yun Guichuan.

424
20:29.880 --> 20:30.320
Here.

425
20:30.550 --> 20:31.310
Follow me.

426
20:31.480 --> 20:32.350
Tell the 1st Platoon to fall in.

427
20:32.350 --> 20:33.110
Yes, sir.

428
20:34.070 --> 20:35.680
Huang, Huang.

429
20:36.300 --> 20:37.860
Is it crooked?

430
20:40.500 --> 20:41.700
It's straight. Fine.

431
20:46.560 --> 20:52.170
[March on Kunming, capture Long Yun alive]

432
20:52.440 --> 20:58.380
[City Defense Command, Kunming, Yunnan]

433
20:53.070 --> 20:53.730
Take a look.

434
20:54.200 --> 20:56.960
The Communists' leaflets are almost pasted on my face.

435
20:56.960 --> 20:58.960
I will order a strict investigation.

436
20:58.960 --> 21:00.680
Where are the relief columns now?

437
21:00.680 --> 21:02.230
The Central Army has reached Baishui and Qujing,

438
21:02.230 --> 21:03.240
Zhanyi, and other places.

439
21:03.240 --> 21:05.480
The 53rd Division of the Hunan Army is nearly at Xuanwei.

440
21:05.480 --> 21:06.120
What about Sun Du?

441
21:06.120 --> 21:07.390
The two brigades of An Enpu and Liu Zhengfu

442
21:07.390 --> 21:08.850
are pushing to the rescue.

443
21:09.030 --> 21:10.160
They're still about a day out.

444
21:10.160 --> 21:11.440
Another day?

445
21:11.760 --> 21:13.890
You'll all be prisoners of Zhu and Mao.

446
21:14.200 --> 21:15.350
Chairman Long, rest assured.

447
21:15.350 --> 21:16.200
I've ordered up

448
21:16.200 --> 21:18.590
every local militia and garrison around Kunming

449
21:18.590 --> 21:19.880
to rush to the city's aid,

450
21:19.880 --> 21:21.280
and Kunming will be safe.

451
21:21.510 --> 21:22.600
If Sun Du doesn't come soon,

452
21:22.600 --> 21:24.260
Kunming will either go to Xue,

453
21:24.410 --> 21:25.820
or to the Communists.

454
21:29.750 --> 21:30.590
Telegraph Sun Du again.

455
21:30.590 --> 21:32.400
It's critical, not a moment to lose.

456
21:32.400 --> 21:33.080
Yes, sir.

457
21:38.880 --> 21:45.110
[Dangui Village, Xundian County, Yunnan]

458
21:39.520 --> 21:40.350
Two months.

459
21:40.920 --> 21:43.200
For two months we've been twisting and turning,

460
21:43.200 --> 21:44.060
marching hard.

461
21:44.160 --> 21:45.690
At last, the chance is here.

462
21:48.070 --> 21:48.790
Right now,

463
21:49.270 --> 21:52.270
the pursuers are far behind us and off to our flank.

464
21:52.720 --> 21:54.780
The Jinsha River banks are nearly undefended.

465
21:54.780 --> 21:56.710
If we don't cross now, when will we?

466
21:57.400 --> 21:58.810
We've put on enough of a show.

467
21:58.810 --> 21:59.960
Time to move.

468
22:00.680 --> 22:01.230
Bocheng,

469
22:01.760 --> 22:03.680
have you worked out the crossing plan?

470
22:03.680 --> 22:04.340
It's ready.

471
22:04.690 --> 22:06.820
We plan to split the main Red Army force

472
22:06.920 --> 22:07.980
into three routes.

473
22:08.550 --> 22:10.690
The 1st Corps takes the left route, heading west,

474
22:10.690 --> 22:11.790
and makes straight for Longjie Ferry.

475
22:11.790 --> 22:13.310
The 3rd Corps is the right wing,

476
22:13.310 --> 22:14.750
and will take Hongmen Ferry.

477
22:14.750 --> 22:17.720
The Military Commission Column and the 5th Corps form the center,

478
22:17.720 --> 22:19.120
to seize Jiaoping Ferry,

479
22:19.220 --> 22:21.460
between Longjie and Hongmen Ferry.

480
22:22.200 --> 22:25.070
The 5th Corps will remain on escort duty,

481
22:25.510 --> 22:27.600
covering the rear.

482
22:28.130 --> 22:30.530
Give each corps a deadline as well.

483
22:31.400 --> 22:32.660
Before May 3,

484
22:32.740 --> 22:34.310
they must secure every crossing.

485
22:34.310 --> 22:34.940
If we're late,

486
22:34.940 --> 22:36.260
the time we've bought

487
22:36.440 --> 22:37.770
will have been for nothing.

488
22:37.770 --> 22:39.700
And we'll be back on the defensive.

489
22:40.880 --> 22:42.000
Where does Jinsha River

490
22:42.000 --> 22:44.200
lead upstream?

491
22:45.470 --> 22:47.760
It's the Tongtian River

492
22:49.480 --> 22:50.530
Tang Sanzang crossed

493
22:50.530 --> 22:52.730
on his journey west for the scriptures.

494
22:52.750 --> 22:55.240
Today, if we want to win,

495
22:55.440 --> 22:57.700
we have to cross this Jinsha River first.

496
22:58.290 --> 22:59.210
Let's go.

497
23:00.900 --> 23:01.620
Slow down.

498
23:03.790 --> 23:05.000
At the very moment the Central Red Army

499
23:05.000 --> 23:07.270
was pushing toward the Jinsha,

500
23:07.950 --> 23:10.250
not long after the Jialing River Campaign,

501
23:10.250 --> 23:11.420
the 4th Front Army

502
23:11.750 --> 23:12.790
hesitated under Zhang Guotao,

503
23:12.790 --> 23:14.590
who was afraid to fight

504
23:14.590 --> 23:16.230
Hu Zongnan's Central Army forces.

505
23:16.230 --> 23:17.270
That hesitation

506
23:17.550 --> 23:20.640
cost them the best chance to advance north into southern Gansu.

507
23:20.640 --> 23:21.890
Facing Chiang Kai-shek's

508
23:21.890 --> 23:24.110
new encirclement and suppression campaign

509
23:24.110 --> 23:25.980
against the Sichuan-Shaanxi base,

510
23:25.980 --> 23:27.510
Zhang Guotao then decided

511
23:27.510 --> 23:29.590
to abandon the base entirely.

512
23:30.400 --> 23:32.640
That spelled the end of the 4th Front Army's plan

513
23:32.640 --> 23:35.990
to use its existing bases

514
23:36.010 --> 23:37.880
to expand into new areas across Sichuan, Shaanxi, and Gansu.

515
23:37.880 --> 23:39.510
The mass of troops withdrawn

516
23:39.510 --> 23:40.930
from the Sichuan-Shaanxi base,

517
23:40.930 --> 23:42.460
along with the rear organs,

518
23:42.510 --> 23:43.590
was concentrated around Jiangyou

519
23:43.590 --> 23:45.920
and Zhongba, a tight pocket of territory.

520
23:46.260 --> 23:48.460
Pressed hard by the Kuomintang forces,

521
23:48.510 --> 23:49.910
they had to decide at once

522
23:50.140 --> 23:51.600
how to break out of danger.

523
23:52.470 --> 23:58.200
[Jiangyou County, Sichuan]

524
24:08.590 --> 24:09.530
On your feet!

525
24:22.440 --> 24:24.370
You've all worked hard, comrades.

526
24:28.670 --> 24:30.520
Sit down.

527
24:34.190 --> 24:34.950
Comrades,

528
24:35.350 --> 24:37.510
first, some good news.

529
24:37.830 --> 24:39.560
Under the CPC Central Committee and

530
24:39.560 --> 24:42.500
the Central Revolutionary Military Commission, our Central Red Army,

531
24:42.410 --> 24:46.410
[Zhang Guotao, Member of the Standing Committee of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee; Chairman of the Northwest Revolutionary Military Commission]

532
24:42.890 --> 24:44.460
has completely escaped

533
24:44.550 --> 24:46.720
the Kuomintang's pursuit and encirclement,

534
24:46.600 --> 24:48.230
[Wang Shusheng, Deputy Commander-in-Chief of the 4th Front Army]

535
24:47.070 --> 24:49.200
and is racing toward the Jinsha River,

536
24:49.640 --> 24:53.040
ready to join our 4th Front Army.

537
24:52.780 --> 24:54.610
[Chen Changhao, Political Commissar of the 4th Front Army] [Huang Chao, Secretary-General of the Northwest Revolutionary Military Commission and of the Sichuan-Shaanxi Provincial Soviet Government]

538
24:54.680 --> 24:56.060
[Xu Xiangqian, Commander-in-Chief of the 4th Front Army]

539
24:56.100 --> 24:57.450
[Xu Shiyou, Commander of the 4th Red Army]

540
24:59.880 --> 25:01.270
Now, a second matter.

541
25:01.720 --> 25:03.980
Once we join up with the Central Red Army,

542
25:04.120 --> 25:06.030
we'll set up a new base area

543
25:06.480 --> 25:08.520
in northwest Sichuan.

544
25:08.960 --> 25:09.760
At that point,

545
25:09.830 --> 25:12.110
building on this new base,

546
25:12.350 --> 25:14.510
we'll carry the revolution across Sichuan,

547
25:14.510 --> 25:15.110
Xikang,

548
25:15.480 --> 25:16.400
Shaanxi,

549
25:16.830 --> 25:17.460
Gansu,

550
25:17.790 --> 25:18.620
Qinghai, and beyond.

551
25:18.370 --> 25:20.980
[Li Xiannian, Political Commissar of the 30th Red Army]

552
25:19.040 --> 25:21.170
Right now, those conditions are ripe.

553
25:21.410 --> 25:24.200
We'll build an even larger

554
25:24.880 --> 25:26.540
northwest Sichuan base area.

555
25:34.440 --> 25:35.180
Xiangqian,

556
25:36.830 --> 25:37.840
what's your view?

557
25:42.460 --> 25:43.540
Chairman Zhang,

558
25:44.170 --> 25:46.590
I'm only responsible for battlefield command.

559
25:46.590 --> 25:47.640
As for the main force's

560
25:47.640 --> 25:49.920
next move and overall plan,

561
25:50.270 --> 25:52.130
I'll leave that for you to decide.

562
25:53.810 --> 25:54.420
Good.

563
25:55.510 --> 25:56.390
So, what's next

564
25:57.380 --> 25:58.830
is this:

565
25:59.830 --> 26:01.160
push west immediately.

566
26:01.200 --> 26:04.030
First, take Beichuan and Maoxian,

567
26:04.510 --> 26:06.720
and the Lifan and Songpan region,

568
26:07.030 --> 26:08.920
using Xikang as our rear,

569
26:09.240 --> 26:12.310
and aim to join the Central Red Army there.

570
26:12.880 --> 26:14.880
That's our strategic plan.

571
26:15.480 --> 26:16.610
Meeting adjourned.

572
26:41.160 --> 26:42.310
Lately I've heard

573
26:42.800 --> 26:44.920
many comrades whispering in private

574
26:45.550 --> 26:46.310
about our

575
26:46.490 --> 26:49.060
decision to give up the Sichuan-Shaanxi base.

576
26:49.060 --> 26:50.390
They have their doubts.

577
26:50.550 --> 26:51.460
That's normal.

578
26:53.840 --> 26:56.640
They haven't grasped the new strategy yet.

579
26:56.790 --> 26:57.700
Of course,

580
26:57.910 --> 26:58.700
that's on me.

581
26:59.160 --> 27:01.270
I didn't explain it clearly enough to you.

582
27:01.270 --> 27:03.030
But if anyone has other views,

583
27:04.000 --> 27:04.960
raise them now.

584
27:05.720 --> 27:07.520
Let's talk them through openly,

585
27:07.600 --> 27:08.200
all right?

586
27:09.640 --> 27:11.170
No more private grumbling.

587
27:13.200 --> 27:14.350
Private muttering

588
27:15.170 --> 27:16.900
undermines morale.

589
27:24.300 --> 27:25.100
That's all.

590
27:46.990 --> 27:48.190
Huang Chao, you stay.

591
28:13.860 --> 28:16.190
Record everything from today's meeting,

592
28:17.240 --> 28:19.370
including who was present.

593
28:19.690 --> 28:21.020
All of it, down on paper.

594
28:29.960 --> 28:33.090
By the decision of the Jiangyou senior cadres' meeting,

595
28:33.110 --> 28:35.480
the 4th Front Army, in early May,

596
28:35.600 --> 28:36.750
pulled out of Zhangming,

597
28:36.750 --> 28:37.440
Zhongba,

598
28:37.550 --> 28:38.170
Qingchuan,

599
28:38.170 --> 28:39.410
Pingwu, and the rest,

600
28:39.550 --> 28:42.610
and moved west toward the Minjiang in several columns.

601
28:48.350 --> 28:52.520
[Outside Luquan County, Yunnan]

602
28:56.070 --> 28:57.270
Lice again?

603
28:58.620 --> 28:59.590
No.

604
29:00.280 --> 29:02.080
Ever since I strapped on this tin hat,

605
29:02.080 --> 29:03.610
I've been itching all over.

606
29:04.180 --> 29:05.180
Just bear with it.

607
29:05.920 --> 29:06.790
Yes.

608
29:07.600 --> 29:09.370
I wonder how the regimental commander is doing.

609
29:09.370 --> 29:11.170
Is it going smoothly over there?

610
29:11.780 --> 29:13.250
We have to take Luquan County

611
29:12.800 --> 29:14.850
[Yang Chengwu, Political Commissar of the 4th Regiment]

612
29:13.510 --> 29:15.420
before we meet the commander at Yuanmou.

613
29:15.420 --> 29:16.460
Tell the comrades,

614
29:16.460 --> 29:18.660
when we get there, don't blow our cover.

615
29:18.850 --> 29:19.450
Yes.

616
29:21.160 --> 29:22.050
Comrades!

617
29:23.030 --> 29:25.090
Who told you to call them "comrades"?

618
29:25.280 --> 29:26.620
Didn't you say that?

619
29:26.690 --> 29:28.250
I was just talking to you.

620
29:33.400 --> 29:34.440
Brothers!

621
29:35.030 --> 29:36.310
Look sharp, all of you.

622
29:36.920 --> 29:38.480
Once we're in Luquan County,

623
29:38.480 --> 29:40.440
we maintain a sharp military bearing!

624
29:40.440 --> 29:41.240
Understand?

625
29:41.590 --> 29:42.720
Yes!

626
29:44.700 --> 29:49.240
[Luquan]

627
29:44.930 --> 29:46.010
Wait.

628
29:46.200 --> 29:47.000
Go on in.

629
30:03.070 --> 30:03.690
Here you go.

630
30:03.690 --> 30:04.250
Sweet?

631
30:08.660 --> 30:09.350
Mister,

632
30:09.430 --> 30:10.710
whose troops is that?

633
30:11.200 --> 30:12.200
I don't know.

634
30:12.230 --> 30:14.630
Doesn't look like our Yunnan Army, anyway.

635
30:16.900 --> 30:19.620
Hey, which unit are you from?

636
30:20.830 --> 30:21.740
Blind, are you?

637
30:22.260 --> 30:24.920
Can't you see the Blue Sky and White Sun on my cap?

638
30:26.590 --> 30:27.200
You're...

639
30:27.220 --> 30:28.550
I'm Central Army.

640
30:29.990 --> 30:31.450
Cut the talk. Lead the way.

641
30:31.680 --> 30:33.670
Our commander wants to see your county magistrate.

642
30:33.670 --> 30:34.430
Right.

643
30:34.480 --> 30:36.310
You, phone the magistrate at once.

644
30:36.310 --> 30:37.710
The Central Army is here.

645
30:37.850 --> 30:38.610
Yes.

646
30:38.930 --> 30:40.530
Come on, move the barricade.

647
30:41.950 --> 30:43.400
This way, sir.

648
30:44.960 --> 30:45.740
After you, sir.

649
30:45.740 --> 30:46.410
Move!

650
30:46.770 --> 30:47.600
Stay with me.

651
30:52.720 --> 30:53.160
Move.

652
30:53.460 --> 30:55.260
Out of the way. Make way.

653
31:06.030 --> 31:07.830
Sir, this is our Magistrate Niu.

654
31:08.580 --> 31:10.580
Welcome here.

655
31:10.610 --> 31:12.870
Forgive me for not greeting you outside.

656
31:13.910 --> 31:16.640
I am Niu Shitong, magistrate of this county.

657
31:17.070 --> 31:20.580
These are the local gentry and notables.

658
31:20.830 --> 31:21.480
Welcome, sir.

659
31:21.480 --> 31:22.640
Welcome, welcome.

660
31:23.090 --> 31:24.010
Thank you all.

661
31:24.590 --> 31:26.880
May I ask how to address you, sir?

662
31:27.570 --> 31:29.090
Which unit are you with?

663
31:29.400 --> 31:31.370
The officer on horseback is our commander,

664
31:31.370 --> 31:32.740
Commander Yang Cheng.

665
31:33.200 --> 31:34.070
We're the Central Army

666
31:34.070 --> 31:35.070
under Commander

667
31:35.070 --> 31:35.920
Xue Yue,

668
31:36.240 --> 31:38.400
the 232nd Regiment, 52nd Division.

669
31:39.590 --> 31:41.110
Oh, you're the commander!

670
31:41.110 --> 31:42.920
My deepest apologies.

671
31:44.160 --> 31:46.690
I had no idea you were coming, Commander Yang.

672
31:46.960 --> 31:48.000
What brings you here?

673
31:48.000 --> 31:50.750
My unit's ordered to the Jinsha River to block the Communists,

674
31:50.750 --> 31:52.000
posting defenses along the way.

675
31:52.000 --> 31:52.670
Shut up.

676
31:57.300 --> 31:58.500
You've worked hard.

677
31:58.650 --> 31:59.850
You've had a long journey.

678
31:59.850 --> 32:00.980
You've worked hard.

679
32:03.380 --> 32:05.100
Read the details yourself.

680
32:05.200 --> 32:06.240
Okay.

681
32:07.070 --> 32:08.270
Have a look.

682
32:17.110 --> 32:18.020
Good, good.

683
32:18.120 --> 32:19.160
Wonderful.

684
32:19.180 --> 32:21.500
Since you carry your superiors' orders,

685
32:21.530 --> 32:24.450
Commander Yang, whatever you need, just say so.

686
32:24.470 --> 32:27.070
The whole county will do everything to help.

687
32:28.190 --> 32:29.120
Magistrate Niu,

688
32:29.630 --> 32:31.830
how many men and guns hold this city now?

689
32:32.070 --> 32:33.400
Right now,

690
32:33.400 --> 32:35.480
the county regulars and the security regiment

691
32:35.480 --> 32:37.880
have already been pulled to defend Kunming.

692
32:37.880 --> 32:40.530
All that's left are a few militiamen,

693
32:40.980 --> 32:42.400
a police squad,

694
32:42.480 --> 32:45.200
and the local gentry's

695
32:45.310 --> 32:46.370
household guards.

696
32:46.480 --> 32:47.880
Add them all up.

697
32:48.110 --> 32:49.110
Just over a hundred.

698
32:49.110 --> 32:49.590
Just over a hundred.

699
32:49.590 --> 32:51.120
A hundred-odd men and guns.

700
32:51.140 --> 32:53.400
Then, Magistrate Niu, send word at once.

701
32:53.510 --> 32:54.530
Ask every man to bring his weapon,

702
32:54.530 --> 32:56.190
and muster here immediately.

703
32:56.560 --> 32:57.280
Right.

704
32:57.570 --> 32:58.770
Did you hear that?

705
32:58.810 --> 32:59.730
Yes, yes.

706
33:01.550 --> 33:04.080
Commander Yang, you've arrived so suddenly.

707
33:04.240 --> 33:06.110
We had no time to prepare.

708
33:06.220 --> 33:08.870
I've set out some wine in the courtyard.

709
33:09.080 --> 33:12.030
I'd be honored if you'd join me.

710
33:12.810 --> 33:14.840
This way, please.

711
33:18.870 --> 33:20.050
Everyone, follow me.

712
33:20.050 --> 33:20.980
Commander Yang,

713
33:21.350 --> 33:22.220
after you.

714
33:33.460 --> 33:35.260
Commander Yang, right this way.

715
33:37.400 --> 33:38.330
Magistrate Niu,

716
33:38.610 --> 33:41.240
we've marched a long way, with men and horses to feed.

717
33:41.240 --> 33:43.770
You don't think one banquet is enough, do you?

718
33:44.150 --> 33:46.910
Commander Yang, your visit came so suddenly.

719
33:47.150 --> 33:48.880
And I've received no

720
33:48.900 --> 33:51.320
order from my superiors to provision the army.

721
33:51.320 --> 33:53.230
This way please.

722
33:53.550 --> 33:54.160
Please.

723
33:56.640 --> 33:57.670
Though...

724
34:02.690 --> 34:03.780
Though what?

725
34:05.030 --> 34:08.280
The Yunnan provincial government did tell

726
34:08.280 --> 34:11.880
my county to raise a sum for army rations.

727
34:12.920 --> 34:15.110
But there is still no order from above.

728
34:15.880 --> 34:17.739
You've seen the official papers.

729
34:17.960 --> 34:19.150
We came all the way to Yunnan

730
34:19.150 --> 34:20.230
to help your Chairman Long

731
34:20.230 --> 34:21.909
encircle and wipe out the Communists.

732
34:21.909 --> 34:24.170
So shouldn't that rations money go to us?

733
34:27.739 --> 34:28.670
Magistrate Niu,

734
34:29.310 --> 34:30.710
the situation is urgent.

735
34:30.840 --> 34:32.110
By the time your superiors' order arrives,

736
34:32.110 --> 34:33.949
the Communists will be long gone.

737
34:33.949 --> 34:36.010
Am I supposed to hunt them down or not?

738
34:36.630 --> 34:38.280
Hunt them down.

739
34:38.760 --> 34:40.840
I'll go get that rations money now.

740
34:40.909 --> 34:41.909
One more thing.

741
34:42.920 --> 34:44.320
Commander, one more?

742
34:44.510 --> 34:46.690
Besides passing through your Luquan County,

743
34:46.690 --> 34:49.190
we also need to pass through Wuding and Yuanmou.

744
34:49.190 --> 34:50.840
Do you know those two magistrates?

745
34:50.840 --> 34:51.920
Wuding?

746
34:52.320 --> 34:53.000
I know him.

747
34:53.670 --> 34:54.469
Oh, very well.

748
34:54.590 --> 34:55.550
Too well.

749
34:55.800 --> 34:57.590
Li Qikang, the Wuding magistrate,

750
34:57.590 --> 34:58.630
is my nephew.

751
34:59.190 --> 35:01.190
And Zhang Wen, the Yuanmou magistrate,

752
35:01.190 --> 35:02.320
is a fellow townsman.

753
35:02.320 --> 35:04.320
Then please call both of them

754
35:04.920 --> 35:07.630
to tell them our troops are entering their towns.

755
35:07.630 --> 35:09.150
Ask them to meet us halfway

756
35:09.360 --> 35:11.250
and not hold up the river-defense operation.

757
35:11.250 --> 35:12.810
Fine, easy enough.

758
35:13.000 --> 35:14.960
I'll call them right now

759
35:15.150 --> 35:17.290
and pick up that rations money.

760
35:18.050 --> 35:21.260
Commander, what about the banquet?

761
35:22.630 --> 35:23.800
Military duties have kept us busy.

762
35:23.800 --> 35:25.030
We're pressed for time.

763
35:25.030 --> 35:25.680
Yes, sir.

764
35:26.560 --> 35:27.930
Take care of our guests.

765
35:27.990 --> 35:28.390
Right.

766
35:28.420 --> 35:29.670
We'll take turns by squad

767
35:29.670 --> 35:30.960
to eat in the courtyard.

768
35:30.960 --> 35:32.630
Squad leaders, pass the word.

769
35:33.000 --> 35:33.760
Yes, sir.

770
35:34.070 --> 35:35.800
First, second, third squads,

771
35:35.820 --> 35:37.220
take your seats in order.

772
35:37.630 --> 35:38.800
Lao San, eat up.

773
35:38.800 --> 35:40.110
Get up, get up, get up.

774
36:06.020 --> 36:08.100
Sir, you're taking some to go, too?

775
36:09.190 --> 36:10.480
It's for Yun Guichuan.

776
36:10.630 --> 36:12.710
I left him behind this time. I'm afraid he'd give us away.

777
36:12.710 --> 36:13.840
The kid's furious.

778
36:14.400 --> 36:15.440
Commander Yang,

779
36:15.440 --> 36:17.960
good news. The calls went through.

780
36:17.960 --> 36:19.920
Both Wuding and Yuanmou

781
36:20.000 --> 36:21.400
have thrown their gates open,

782
36:21.400 --> 36:22.960
ready to welcome

783
36:22.980 --> 36:25.090
the Central Army.

784
36:26.070 --> 36:29.400
Right, here is the rations money my county raised.

785
36:29.510 --> 36:31.000
Please count it here.

786
36:31.890 --> 36:32.690
Come.

787
36:33.280 --> 36:34.430
This way.

788
36:37.470 --> 36:38.220
Good.

789
36:40.380 --> 36:42.480
Don't worry. I'll report to my superiors

790
36:42.480 --> 36:44.590
and see that Chairman Long rewards you well.

791
36:44.590 --> 36:45.110
Good.

792
36:45.110 --> 36:46.630
Thank you, Commander.

793
36:47.220 --> 36:48.260
Faster.

794
36:51.080 --> 36:52.810
Magistrate, everyone's here.

795
36:53.000 --> 36:53.880
All here?

796
36:54.400 --> 36:55.880
Report, all present.

797
36:56.120 --> 36:56.780
Good, good.

798
36:56.960 --> 36:58.250
Commander Yang, look.

799
36:58.280 --> 37:00.720
every able man of the county's defense force

800
37:00.720 --> 37:02.640
is now assembled.

801
37:02.740 --> 37:03.800
Please address them, sir.

802
37:03.800 --> 37:04.590
Everyone here?

803
37:04.590 --> 37:06.050
Report, sir, all present.

804
37:06.280 --> 37:07.590
The rest are outside.

805
37:07.610 --> 37:09.340
Good. You've all eaten?

806
37:09.440 --> 37:10.590
Yes, sir.

807
37:11.480 --> 37:12.170
Get to work.

808
37:17.980 --> 37:18.910
Nobody move.

809
37:19.370 --> 37:21.680
Put your guns down. Hands up!

810
37:21.710 --> 37:22.590
Hands up!

811
37:22.610 --> 37:23.690
Disarm them.

812
37:25.120 --> 37:25.890
Hurry!

813
37:27.130 --> 37:28.210
Don't move!

814
37:29.020 --> 37:31.500
Commander Yang, what are you doing?

815
37:31.650 --> 37:32.580
Magistrate Niu,

816
37:33.250 --> 37:35.070
on behalf of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army,

817
37:35.070 --> 37:37.800
thank you for your hospitality and cooperation.

818
37:37.990 --> 37:38.720
Mao Zhenhua.

819
37:38.960 --> 37:39.640
Here!

820
37:39.840 --> 37:41.210
Third platoon, hold the town

821
37:41.210 --> 37:42.280
and wait for the main force.

822
37:42.280 --> 37:44.730
Third platoon stays. Everyone else, with me.

823
37:44.730 --> 37:45.340
Yes, sir.

824
37:45.450 --> 37:50.860
[Yangming Cave, Xiuwen, Guizhou]

825
37:46.360 --> 37:49.000
Gentlemen, do you know how long Wang Yangming

826
37:49.240 --> 37:50.630
sat observing bamboo?

827
37:51.670 --> 37:53.460
Seven days and seven nights.

828
37:55.110 --> 37:56.760
The sages' philosophy

829
37:57.320 --> 37:59.550
still holds enormous power.

830
37:59.960 --> 38:01.360
Back then, Japan grasped

831
38:01.670 --> 38:03.000
only the basics of uniting knowledge with action

832
38:03.000 --> 38:05.230
and cultivating one's innate moral sense

833
38:05.230 --> 38:07.480
and that was enough to bring about the Meiji Restoration,

834
38:07.480 --> 38:10.150
making a weak Japan

835
38:10.590 --> 38:12.800
into one of today's great powers.

836
38:14.030 --> 38:16.230
The late Premier taught that knowing is hard but acting is easy.

837
38:16.230 --> 38:17.430
His idea of “knowing”

838
38:17.880 --> 38:19.680
follows the same line of thought

839
38:19.760 --> 38:21.910
as Wang Yangming's.

840
38:22.030 --> 38:23.030
So, gentlemen,

841
38:24.000 --> 38:26.510
you still need to understand

842
38:27.150 --> 38:29.000
that word "knowing" far better.

843
38:29.480 --> 38:31.800
The Generalissimo sees the bigger picture.

844
38:31.800 --> 38:33.280
Your words have opened our eyes.

845
38:33.280 --> 38:35.030
Now everything is clear to us.

846
38:35.220 --> 38:36.380
I understand, sir.

847
38:36.720 --> 38:37.430
Report!

848
38:41.590 --> 38:44.250
Urgent telegram from Commander-in-Chief Xue!

849
38:46.220 --> 38:47.140
Tell me.

850
38:51.080 --> 38:53.270
The Zhu-Mao Communists have slipped out of the Kunming outskirts

851
38:53.270 --> 38:54.290
and split into several columns,

852
38:54.290 --> 38:56.490
heading straight for the Jinsha River.

853
39:05.040 --> 39:06.560
[Yang Yongtai, Secretary-General of the Wuchang Field Headquarters]

854
39:05.380 --> 39:06.790
Truly cunning.

855
39:07.190 --> 39:08.920
When he feinted at Guiyang,

856
39:09.150 --> 39:11.150
even though he finally bolted west,

857
39:11.390 --> 39:12.590
at least we used it

858
39:12.620 --> 39:15.150
to seize military and political control of Guizhou.

859
39:15.150 --> 39:16.030
But now,

860
39:16.240 --> 39:18.070
his diversion ended up

861
39:18.480 --> 39:20.550
doing Long Yun a huge favor.

862
39:20.920 --> 39:23.960
The Yunnan Army has fallen back to the area around Kunming.

863
39:23.960 --> 39:25.250
If we now try to use the Guizhou model

864
39:25.250 --> 39:26.510
to take Yunnan in hand,

865
39:26.820 --> 39:27.680
it will be hard.

866
39:28.850 --> 39:31.410
Generalissimo, let's hurry back to the headquarters.

867
39:31.410 --> 39:32.410
No, no, no.

868
39:33.000 --> 39:33.830
Gentlemen,

869
39:35.070 --> 39:36.400
there's no need to rush.

870
39:38.360 --> 39:39.110
Come on,

871
39:39.130 --> 39:40.260
sit down, all of you.

872
39:41.420 --> 39:41.980
Please.

873
39:42.070 --> 39:42.680
Here.

874
39:46.350 --> 39:47.830
Sit.

875
39:50.630 --> 39:51.270
Yes, sir.

876
39:56.510 --> 39:58.240
Let me ask you something first.

877
40:00.260 --> 40:01.900
About Mao Zedong—

878
40:03.640 --> 40:06.070
how much do you really know?

879
40:16.880 --> 40:18.740
The Zhu-Mao Communists this time

880
40:18.950 --> 40:20.610
have jumped and doubled back so often,

881
40:20.610 --> 40:21.690
yet their real goal

882
40:22.230 --> 40:24.210
is still to go upriver, north into Sichuan,

883
40:24.210 --> 40:25.950
and join Xu Xiangqian's forces.

884
40:25.950 --> 40:27.790
It seems this Mao Zedong

885
40:27.920 --> 40:30.180
has mastered the art of deception in war.

886
40:44.790 --> 40:46.450
The first time I met Mao Zedong

887
40:46.630 --> 40:48.280
was at the First Congress of our party.

888
40:48.280 --> 40:49.840
The thirteenth year of the Republic.

889
40:49.840 --> 40:50.840
He was a delegate.

890
40:50.860 --> 40:52.440
I was only a non-voting observer.

891
40:52.440 --> 40:53.700
I remember it clearly.

892
40:53.920 --> 40:55.780
He gave a speech at that congress.

893
40:55.860 --> 40:57.610
That thick Hunan accent

894
40:58.500 --> 41:00.060
is still fresh in my memory.

895
41:00.350 --> 41:01.550
Dr. Sun even proposed

896
41:01.830 --> 41:05.550
that he serve as an alternate member of the Central Executive Committee.

897
41:05.550 --> 41:07.920
Later he became our party's

898
41:07.950 --> 41:09.450
acting head of the Propaganda Department.

899
41:09.450 --> 41:11.000
Back then I thought the man

900
41:11.030 --> 41:12.690
was nothing but a pen-pusher.

901
41:12.840 --> 41:15.760
The pen-pusher now wields a gun.

902
41:16.760 --> 41:17.920
From Jinggang Mountain to Jiangxi,

903
41:17.920 --> 41:19.110
and to this day,

904
41:19.920 --> 41:22.270
he has time and again put our army on the defensive.

905
41:22.270 --> 41:25.230
The man does seem to have some skill.

906
41:25.570 --> 41:26.860
But in my view,

907
41:27.920 --> 41:29.250
it's mostly luck.

908
41:30.170 --> 41:30.960
Zurong,

909
41:31.510 --> 41:34.320
he's kept our army on the defensive for years.

910
41:34.420 --> 41:35.500
Surely that takes more

911
41:35.500 --> 41:37.420
than luck.

912
41:39.240 --> 41:40.900
A pen-pusher with a gun in hand

913
41:41.240 --> 41:42.540
is not to be taken lightly.

914
41:42.540 --> 41:44.470
Take Wang Yangming, for instance,

915
41:44.710 --> 41:46.400
the sage who spread the Way.

916
41:46.440 --> 41:47.580
Once he took command of troops,

917
41:47.580 --> 41:49.240
didn't he astonish the world?

918
41:49.510 --> 41:50.720
More than astonish.

919
41:51.360 --> 41:52.550
Wang Yangming's three imperishables—

920
41:52.550 --> 41:55.070
virtue, achievement, and writings—

921
41:55.770 --> 41:57.330
are the envy of the world.

922
41:57.960 --> 41:58.760
Very well.

923
41:59.000 --> 42:02.050
Today, on the banks of the Jinsha River,

924
42:02.840 --> 42:04.800
the pen and the gun

925
42:05.330 --> 42:06.860
will fight it out once more.

926
42:07.510 --> 42:09.320
Zurong, draft the orders.

927
42:10.190 --> 42:11.280
Tell Xue Yue's forces

928
42:11.280 --> 42:13.190
to keep up the pursuit.

929
42:13.690 --> 42:14.690
Order the air force

930
42:14.690 --> 42:17.150
to reconnoiter the Jinsha River round the clock,

931
42:17.150 --> 42:18.620
reporting the Communists' movements as they happen.

932
42:18.620 --> 42:19.550
Order Liu Wenhui

933
42:19.670 --> 42:21.510
to guard every crossing on the Jinsha,

934
42:21.510 --> 42:23.190
seize every boat at the ferries,

935
42:23.190 --> 42:24.390
and let not a single soul of the Zhu-Mao Communists

936
42:24.390 --> 42:26.180
cross the Jinsha River.

937
42:26.510 --> 42:27.070
Yes, sir.

938
42:27.090 --> 42:28.960
Generalissimo, what about Long Yun?

939
42:28.960 --> 42:29.800
Long Yun?

940
42:30.070 --> 42:32.320
As long as the Communists are still in Yunnan,

941
42:32.320 --> 42:34.880
Long Zhizhou can forget about sitting this one out.

942
42:34.880 --> 42:35.680
Wire Long Yun:

943
42:36.030 --> 42:37.440
all troops entering Yunnan

944
42:37.440 --> 42:39.000
come under his command.

945
42:39.210 --> 42:40.120
Tell him

946
42:40.650 --> 42:43.180
I'm coming to Kunming to direct the campaign.

947
42:43.440 --> 42:44.280
Yes, sir.

948
42:51.530 --> 42:54.330
[Ya'an, Sichuan]

949
42:55.650 --> 42:56.380
Uncle.

950
42:57.510 --> 42:58.360
You're just in time.

951
42:58.360 --> 43:00.090
The pot's coming to a boil. Sit.

952
43:00.220 --> 43:02.300
Uncle, at a time like this,

953
43:02.710 --> 43:04.460
how can you still think of hot pot?
